+            </h2>
+            <p>
+              {hasAny
+                ? "Try another search."
+                : status === "archived"
+                  ? `Archived ${noun}s will appear here.`
+                  : types
+                    ? "Add a service period such as Lunch or Dinner, with its default hours."
